   "number": "87.6",
   "text": "(1) A decision of the director under this Part must (a) be in writing, (b) be signed and dated by the director, and (c) include the reasons for the decision. (2) Except as otherwise provided in this Part, a decision or an order of the director under this Part is final and binding on the person subject to the decision or order.",
   "part": "Part 5.1 — Administrative Penalties",
